msgid "Save your login credentials instead of manually entering them"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial login kamu agar tidak perlu memasukkannya secara manual"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial login kamu"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials {#save-your-login-credentials}"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial login kamu {#save-your-login-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally, then use them to initialize the service.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu bekerja di lingkungan Python yang terpercaya (misalnya laptop atau workstation pribadi), kamu bisa menggunakan metode `save_account()` untuk menyimpan kredensial secara lokal, lalu menggunakannya untuk menginisialisasi layanan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"      * Kalau kamu menggunakan komputer publik atau lingkungan yang tidak terpercaya, ikuti petunjuk di [Inisialisasi layanan di lingkungan yang tidak terpercaya](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Ikuti [petunjuk ini](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) jika kamu ingin terhubung menggunakan REST API alih-alih Qiskit.\n"
"      * Jika diperlukan, gunakan [informasi ini](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) untuk mengonfigurasi firewall agar bisa mengakses endpoint API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum mulai {#before-you-begin}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK and Qiskit Runtime installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [`qiskit` and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` packages installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu bekerja di lingkungan Python yang aktif dengan [Qiskit SDK dan Qiskit Runtime terinstal](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan virtual environment Python dan jalankan Python di dalamnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Masuk ke [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Temukan kredensial akses kamu {#find-your-access-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan akun dan region yang benar sudah dipilih di account switcher di header.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key. From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. Note that you can use the same API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Temukan API key kamu. Dari [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), buat API key kamu, lalu salin ke lokasi yang aman agar bisa digunakan untuk autentikasi. Perlu diketahui bahwa kamu bisa menggunakan API key yang sama untuk terhubung ke region mana pun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Opsional: Temukan instance yang ingin kamu gunakan dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Arahkan kursor ke CRN-nya, klik ikon untuk menyalinnya, lalu simpan di lokasi yang aman agar bisa digunakan untuk mengidentifikasi instance tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your access credentials {#save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial akses kamu {#save-your-access-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the steps in [Initialize the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgid "Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the steps in [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial kamu dengan menjalankan kode yang sesuai sekali per akun yang ingin kamu simpan. Setelah menyimpan kredensial, muat kredensial tersebut dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah di [Inisialisasi layanan Qiskit Runtime.](/guides/initialize-account)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials that access a specific instance: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial yang mengakses instance tertentu: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Qiskit Runtime which instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgid "If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Quantum Compute which instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu punya beberapa instance dan ingin dengan mudah memberi tahu Qiskit Runtime instance mana yang harus digunakan, simpan kredensial yang menyertakan CRN instance.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials for automatic instance selection: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"
msgstr "Simpan kredensial untuk pemilihan instance otomatis: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Qiskit Runtime, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the specified options.\n"
msgid "If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Quantum Compute, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the specified options.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu tidak menyertakan CRN instance dan meneruskan kredensial ini ke Qiskit Runtime, instance yang sesuai akan dipilihkan untukmu berdasarkan opsi yang ditentukan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2 {#example-2}"
msgstr "Contoh 2 {#example-2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Qiskit Runtime will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgid "This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Quantum Compute will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menyimpan kredensial untuk pemilihan instance otomatis. Qiskit Runtime hanya akan melihat instance premium di region EU yang tersedia untuk akun tersebut. Kredensial ini menjadi default yang baru.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View saved credentials {#view-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Lihat kredensial yang tersimpan {#view-saved-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To view all credentials that you have saved, run `service.saved_accounts()`.  Note that if you saved default credentials and didn't name them, they are named `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. If you did name your default credentials, you will see `\"is_default_account\": true` in the output.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat semua kredensial yang sudah kamu simpan, jalankan `service.saved_accounts()`. Perlu diketahui bahwa jika kamu menyimpan kredensial default tanpa menamainya, kredensial tersebut akan diberi nama `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. Jika kamu menamakan kredensial default, kamu akan melihat `\"is_default_account\": true` di output.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations {#considerations}"
msgstr "Pertimbangan {#considerations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are saving multiple accounts, use the `name` parameter to differentiate them.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu menyimpan beberapa akun, gunakan parameter `name` untuk membedakannya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credentials are saved to `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`.  Do not manually edit this file.\n"
msgstr "Kredensial disimpan di `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`. Jangan edit file ini secara manual.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you start a new session (instantiate the Qiskit Runtime service).\n"
msgid "If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you start a new session (instantiate IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu tidak menyimpan kredensial, kamu harus menentukannya setiap kali memulai sesi baru (menginstansiasi layanan Qiskit Runtime).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you manually specify your credentials, a saved account will not be used.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu menentukan kredensial secara manual, akun yang tersimpan tidak akan digunakan.\n"

